  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultative Group to Assist the Poor (CGAP) Clients, Products and Branchless Banking Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The specific development objective of the CGAP Client Research &amp; Technology Program - MasterCard Foundation Trust Fund is to help achieve responsible financial inclusion at scale for the poor through (i) Applied Product Innovation in developing and translating consumer insights into new branchless banking financial services that both meets the needs of poor consumers and is economically viable for providers; ii) expanding branchless banking into one of the poorest sub-regions of the world, the eight countries of the West African Monetary and Economic Union (WAMEU); and iii) partnering with stakeholders to generate relevant knowledge on clients&apos; preferences, behaviors, segments, financial service needs that is critical for business models and product innovation.</narrative>
  </description>
